.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tradebench repo summary.md
to dos.txt

# runs/ is scratch - every run lands there and most are throwaway - EXCEPT the
# evaluation batch, which is the data behind every figure on the site. A blanket
# "runs/" would make the site's numbers uncheckable, so the scratch is ignored
# per-entry and the evaluation set is re-included.
runs/*
!runs/evaluation runs/

# evaluation/ holds the judge rubric, the scorers and their outputs. Tracked so
# that co-national recognition and the blind disposition panel can be re-run and
# re-checked by someone who is not us.
!baselines/

# notes/ is the working area: handover docs written for a Claude Code session,
# site-copy drafts, the build brief. All addressed to us, not to a reader of the
# repo. Kept locally, out of the public tree.
notes/
